[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016651755","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108087#issuecomment-3016651755","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108087","id":3016651755,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zznPr","user":{"login":"lazydevl0per","id":126037837,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4MvTQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126037837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per","html_url":"https://github.com/lazydevl0per","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-29T12:28:34Z","updated_at":"2025-06-30T10:31:19Z","body":"I am thinking if it would be smart to move the change of input and output device from the thread function to the proper set_input/output_device() locations?\r\n\r\nThe current problem i have with this solution is that in the godot project provided for replicating the bug you can see that if you log the selected Audio Input Device Name, switch the Device and log the name again then the thread_func is not fast enough to catch up with actually changing so that the second log output still wont have the correct selected input device.\r\n\r\n\r\nI didnt measure how expensive the cleanup and re-init of the devices is because then the call to AudioServer.set_input_device() would be blocking a little bit (the time it takes for cleanup and re-init).\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/617c9933-b6b7-4d2e-973e-b3afee761448)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbee7b7d-efce-401f-b4f5-72ddfbf43288)\r\n\r\nP.S: On the second picture you can see how i busted my speakers 👍 \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT:: I have to admit, I have never properly used the Godot engine as such I dont have the knowledge to properly test the Editor. I am mainly a Unity guy and chose to just fix one bug here.\r\nThe mentioned testing consideration could be done for additional security but should not be neccessary since I mainly extracted code from large functions and separated into smaller ones.\r\nThe fix for the bug itself is minimal.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016651755/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027403276","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108087#issuecomment-3027403276","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108087","id":3027403276,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60coIM","user":{"login":"kevinloustau","id":4235617,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzU2MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4235617?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinloustau","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinloustau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinloustau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinloustau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinloustau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinloustau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinloustau/